As per our telephone conversation, I am sending you as a promise some cases researched by me and the researcher Elisângela Anderson who also directs together with me a public utility entity that we maintain in Pelotas-RS, the Scientific Research Group - UFOlogy - GPCl), which aims to scientifically research the phenomenon of unidentified aerial objects, analyze photos and films, and primarily assist without distinction people not only from this city but from the entire state of Rio Grande do Sul and Sul.

The attached materials are:

1. - The observation of a UFO by State Deputy Paulo Azeredo;
2. - Research on the mass observation in the southern region of RS;
3. - The latest number of the Informative Bulletin of GPCU;
4. - Copy of the photo taken by Mr. Lemar Prado on April 29th around 8 am during a commemoration within the 9th Battalion, in the photo his son, now 2nd Lieutenant Fábio Conceição e Silva (the photo was not analyzed by GPCU as another entity requested the negative and at the moment it had not been returned);
5. - Partial copies of the document from the North American Air Force - "Project Silver Bug-1955", a document that for almost 4 decades was considered confidential and now released by FOIA - North American Law of Freedom of Information.

I hope you appreciate the material and that from now on we can collaborate mutually in our research, respecting the way each institution handles the subject.
